{"id":25,"date":"2016-05-16T12:47:58","date_gmt":"2016-05-16T12:47:58","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/masterbadminton.dev\/badminton-articles\/"},"modified":"2016-09-06T12:08:33","modified_gmt":"2016-09-06T12:08:33","slug":"badminton-articles","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/badminton-articles.html","title":{"rendered":"Badminton Articles"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"ContentColumn\">\n<div class=\"Liner\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-right: 10px;\">We are proud to launch this badminton articles section on www.how-to-play-badminton.com<\/div>\n<p>Our website has covered badminton techniques, skills, strategies and tips on choosing equipment.<\/p>\n<p>Since we have received many questions regarding badminton, we will be<br \/>\nupdating this section to help everyone<br \/>\nunderstand the game better.<\/p>\n<p>We look forward to building up this articles section.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18.6px; color: #ff3300;\"><b>About the Game<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"history-of-badminton.html\"><strong>History of Badminton<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nFind out about the history and the development of the sport.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-champion.html\"><strong>Badminton Champions of All Time<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nWho exactly can be considered a &#8220;champion&#8221; in badminton? Who are the all-time greats?<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ff0000;\"><b>Playing the Game<br \/>\n<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-psychology.html\"><strong>Game Psychology<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nUnderstanding badminton psychology is important for winning competitive games. It goes beyond skills to determine a true winner.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-shots.html\"><strong>Types of Shots<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nFind out about the different types of badminton shots. Learn how to perform each one of them to win badminton games!<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-singles.html\"><strong>Winning a Singles Game<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nLearn how to win in badminton singles with these simple strategies and skills.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-doubles.html\"><strong>Winning a Doubles Game<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nWin badminton doubles by learning basic strategies and skills to beat your opponents!<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-strategy.html\"><strong>How to Develop a Winning Strategy<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nFormulate\u00a0your own badminton strategy to beat better opponents intelligently! Get\u00a0ideas on different strategies you can use in a game.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ff0000;\"><b>Tournaments<br \/>\n<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-Olympics.html\"><strong>The Olympics: The Most Prestigious Badminton Tournament<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nThere is no prize money in the Olympics. So what is it about the Olympics that players play for?<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-world-championships.html\"><strong>BWF Badminton World Championships<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nInformation about the BWF Badminton World Championships, what it is about and its history.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"all-england-badminton.html\"><strong>All England Badminton Championships<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nInformation on the All England Badminton tournament, the oldest and most prestigious badminton tournament in the world.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-super-series.html\"><strong>Badminton Super Series Tournaments<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nExplanation on what the superseries tournaments are about.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"\/\">Return from <b>Badminton Articles<\/b> to <strong>Home <\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"redtagtitlelfb\"><b style=\"display: none;\">Please Like me on Facebook. Thanks!<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/HowToPlayBadminton\" data-send=\"true\" data-width=\"100%\" data-show-faces=\"false\">\n<div id=\"COMMENTING\" class=\"fb-comment\">\n<div class=\"retnvbx\">